---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Pauline Lee, Founder & Lead Guide of Simply Enak',
  description: 'Pauline Lee founded Simply Enak in 2011 and has guided Kuala Lumpur street food tours ever since. Meet the founder and lead guide of Simply Enak.',
};

const breadcrumb = {
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Simply Enak', item: 'https://simplyenak.com/' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'About', item: 'https://simplyenak.com/about/' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 3, name: 'Pauline Lee', item: 'https://simplyenak.com/about/pauline/' },
  ],
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata} structuredData={breadcrumb}>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative bg-[#1a1a1a] text-white overflow-hidden py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <p class="text-accent text-xs md:text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.25em] font-bold mb-5">Our Team</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold font-heading leading-tight mb-5" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.75rem);">Pauline Lee</h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Founder & Lead Guide, Simply Enak</p>
      <div class="mt-8 max-w-xs mx-auto"><img src="https://se-website-images.s3.nl-ams.scw.cloud/payload-media/pauline-founder-portrait.jpg" alt="Pauline Lee" class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-2xl border-2 border-white/10" loading="eager" /></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="bg-page border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-muted">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Home</a>
        <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        <a href="/about" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">About</a>
        <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        <span class="text-default font-semibold">Pauline Lee</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Who is ... (entity facts) -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-heading text-default mb-8">Who Is Pauline Lee?</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-default leading-relaxed">
        <p>Pauline Lee is a food tour guide and the founder of Simply Enak, a food tour company in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia. Pauline founded Simply Enak in 2011, and she has guided street food tours in Kuala Lumpur ever since. Guests on her tours know her simply as Pauline.</p>
        <p>Pauline Lee grew up in Malaysia, walking wet markets with her mother while hawkers around her cooked dishes their families had made for generations. She started Simply Enak so travellers could taste that side of Malaysia: the stalls, the vendors she knows by name, and the stories behind every dish.</p>
        <p>Pauline Lee leads small-group and private food tours in Kuala Lumpur neighbourhoods such as Chinatown, Chow Kit and Jalan Alor, and she guides food tours in George Town, Penang. Thousands of guests have reviewed her tours on TripAdvisor, GetYourGuide, Viator and Google. Pauline Lee therefore is the founder of Simply Enak and a Kuala Lumpur food tour guide with more than a decade of experience.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Story -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white dark:bg-[#1e1c1c]">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-heading text-default mb-8">From Wet Markets to Simply Enak</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-default leading-relaxed">
        <p>Growing up, Pauline spent her mornings walking through wet markets with her mom. While her mom haggled for the freshest fish, Pauline watched hawkers craft dishes passed down through generations. The sizzle of char kway teow on a screaming hot wok. The aromatic clouds of curry. The careful art of folding roti canai. This was her Malaysia.</p>
        <p>When friends visited from overseas, she took them past the air-conditioned restaurants with picture menus, two streets over to where a grandmother made laksa the same way her mother taught her 60 years earlier. In 2011, those walks became Simply Enak.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Guest quotes -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-heading text-default mb-10">What Guests Say About Touring with Pauline</h2>
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-accent pl-6"><p class="text-lg text-default leading-relaxed">&ldquo;Pauline gave us a wonderful tour of Chinatown! So many things I'd not noticed before, all the wonderful tastes and flavours of Malaysia and relaxing cocktails.&rdquo;</p><cite class="block mt-3 text-sm text-muted not-italic">&mdash; Laura Scott, TripAdvisor review</cite></blockquote>
        <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-accent pl-6"><p class="text-lg text-default leading-relaxed">&ldquo;Pauline was an awesome guide for our food tour around Old KL. Even though it was super humid, she made the walk really fun with her friendly vibe and great stories.&rdquo;</p><cite class="block mt-3 text-sm text-muted not-italic">&mdash; Alicia Hiew, GetYourGuide review</cite></blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Profiles / corroboration links -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#151313]">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold font-heading text-default mb-6">Find Pauline Lee Online</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-default">
        <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/pauline-simplyenak/" rel="nofollow" class="text-primary hover:text-accent font-semibold transition-colors">Pauline Lee on LinkedIn &rarr;</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g298570-d2414763-Reviews-Simply_Enak_Food_Experiences-Kuala_Lumpur_Wilayah_Persekutuan.html" class="text-primary hover:text-accent font-semibold transition-colors">Simply Enak on TripAdvisor &rarr;</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.getyourguide.com/simply-enak-food-experiences-s4050/" class="text-primary hover:text-accent font-semibold transition-colors">Simply Enak on GetYourGuide &rarr;</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about" class="text-primary hover:text-accent font-semibold transition-colors">About Simply Enak &rarr;</a></li>
        <li><a href="/tours" class="text-primary hover:text-accent font-semibold transition-colors">All Food Tours &rarr;</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-[#1a1a1a] py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-heading text-white mb-5">Walk Kuala Lumpur with Pauline</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 leading-relaxed">Join a small-group tour or book a private walk through the neighbourhoods she grew up eating in.</p>
      <a href="/tours" class="inline-block bg-accent text-black font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-sm hover:bg-white transition-colors">See Food Tours</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
